@title Bench packet: the wiring sign-off sheet is written with the packet
@area Reports
# Reports > Bench output > Bench packet (PDF) now ends with the wiring sign-off sheet (tick boxes per circuit
# sheet, Wired by / Tested by / Accepted by lines). The PDF is checked by the unit test
# bench_packet_tests; this scenario checks the button still writes a file at the usual size.
open_starter_example
wait 20
click_text Reports
wait 5
click_text "Bench output..."
wait 20
expect "Bench packet (PDF)"
shot window
click_text "Bench packet (PDF)"
wait 30
expect_file "~/Documents/KoperCAD/*bench packet.pdf" 1500
keep_file "~/Documents/KoperCAD/*bench packet.pdf"
shot written
check_layout
